      "message": "Note the `int64_t` casts in `FixedDiv_C()` and `FixedDiv1_C()`, which apparently also assume `int` is smaller than `int64_t`. I think the assumption that `int` is 32 bits is so prevalent (not just in libyuv) that it is impossible to increase `int` to 64 bits in practice.\n\nIn any case, casting `int` to `long long` is a good solution to a future `int` that is larger than `int64_t`.",
